{
  "_comment": [
    "Hierarchical decision engine v3 (SHADOW challenger) -- League Intelligence",
    "Stage E.  Read by src/trade/decision_engine/policy.py.  Every number and",
    "every policy row is a PRIOR: a declared judgement, not a fitted constant.",
    "No outcome labels exist to calibrate a trade-recommendation policy, so the",
    "table is EVALUATED as a challenger against the served owner",
    "(src/trade/trade_decision.py), never promoted by this file.",
    "",
    "There is NO aggregate utility and NO weight: the policy table is keyed by",
    "strategy x A-class x P-class.  A = the market asset term (adjusted package",
    "gap classified by the ONE fairness-band owner).  P = the one voting term of",
    "the league_scored_projection lineage group (the best-ball lineup delta C",
    "today; an outcome layer D1/D2 only once its family is promoted).",
    "Classes: F+ favours-large, F favours-modest, 0 neutral (precise and within",
    "band), O opposes-modest, O+ opposes-large, '-' P does not vote (including",
    "an imprecise or precision-unknown C: missing evidence, never neutral).",
    "Verdict TIE = NO with neutralTag and LOW confidence (conservative tie:",
    "advantage indistinguishable from keeping the current roster).",
    "",
    "Row semantics start from the owner's existing rule (strategy breaks a",
    "disagreement): LONG_TERM follows A; WIN_NOW takes a large lineup gain over",
    "package value and gives up a lineup loss only for a large value gain with",
    "a modest loss; BALANCED lets the larger magnitude decide and treats equal",
    "magnitudes as cancelling.  A single term that clears its band with the",
    "other neutral is never vetoed.  materialityPpg and largeMultiple are NOT",
    "owned here: they are read from config/trade/analyze_trade.json so one",
    "number has one owner."
  ],
  "version": "decision_engine_v1",
  "status": "PRIOR",
  "engineVersion": "decision_engine_v3_shadow",
  "terms": {
    "A": {
      "bandsOwner": "src/valuation_math/fairness_bands.py",
      "levelToMagnitude": {"fair": null, "slight": "modest", "unfair": "large", "lopsided": "large"}
    },
    "C": {
      "materialityPpgFrom": "config/trade/analyze_trade.json#rosterUtility.materialityPpg",
      "largeMultipleFrom": "config/trade/analyze_trade.json#rosterUtility.largeMultiple",
      "zPrior": 0.5,
      "zPriorClass": "PRIOR",
      "zPriorRationale": "Half a predictive standard deviation of the lineup delta.  Inert until a predictive_sd exists (predictive_basis 'unavailable' today), when the band is materialityPpg alone.",
      "precisionGateFraction": 0.5,
      "precisionHighFraction": 0.3333,
      "precisionGateRationale": "The estimate is precise enough to classify only when its Monte-Carlo standard error is at most half the magnitude band.  The band itself never shrinks with draws, so more draws can only tighten precision, never manufacture a distinguishable result.",
      "notApplicableReasons": [
        "season_unresolved",
        "no_remaining_fantasy_weeks"
      ]
    },
    "D1": {
      "materialityDelta": 0.02,
      "materialityDeltaClass": "PRIOR",
      "unit": "title probability (absolute)"
    },
    "D2": {
      "materialityPpg": 1.0,
      "materialityPpgClass": "PRIOR",
      "unit": "multi-season lineup ppg (mean over horizon seasons)"
    }
  },
  "pTermPrecedence": [
    "D1",
    "D2",
    "C"
  ],
  "pTermPrecedenceRationale": "An outcome layer replaces C as the ONE league_scored_projection vote only when its family is promoted and its state is available; precedence is earned by preregistered evidence, never by availability.",
